Hi {!relatedTo.SBQQ__Opportunity2__r.Owner.Name}

Opportunity {!relatedTo.NSP_Opportunity_Name__c} has been approved. To view the Opportunity , Click Here: <apex:outputText value=" {!LEFT($Api.Partner_Server_URL_140, FIND(".com/",$Api.Partner_Server_URL_140)+3)}/{!relatedTo.SBQQ__Opportunity2__r.Id}"/>
</messaging:plainTextEmailBody>
